REQUEST_VERSION 1.0.0

ID REQUEST-0014

STATUS APPROVED

DATE 2026-07-27

WHO President Cley Duarte

SCOPE PACE

TITLE

Updating must be one step -- the CLI equivalent of "want to update now?
press here".

RAW_TEXT

El pip install --upgrade pace-engine sera un link que ejecuta inmediato o
reemplazar o agregar desea actualizarlo ahora presione aqui.

PROPOSED_SCOPE PACE

DESIGN_NOTE

A terminal has no buttons, so the closest honest equivalents are built:
(1) a new `pace update` command that runs the pip upgrade itself -- one
short command, the CLI's "button"; the update WARN now suggests it first.
(2) In AI-driven chats the AI reading the WARN can simply run the update
for the user after their yes -- which is exactly "press here" in
conversation form.

PROMOTED_TO

F6-33 (pace update command; WARN text now points to it)

APPROVED_BY

President Cley Duarte

END
